      "name": "Omar",
      "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:35:49.804Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, I <strong>really need 3-decimal precision</strong> in my invoices and accounting:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Currency: <strong>TND</strong>, which is divided into <strong>1000 millimes</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Supplier invoices and our internal accounting are all done with <strong>3 decimals</strong>, so ERPNext must be able to match these values exactly.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
